{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0104_1000_p", "source_sha256": "33f959db8fbdb346ad86efe65cc08bb2f0f949483cee907bab68d5b8c435d4a2", "ja": "（レッスン明けの桃子から呼び出された。\n何かあったのかな……）", "zh": "（刚结束训练课程的桃子找我出来，\n她到底有什么事呢……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0104_1001_049mom", "source_sha256": "4318359e1b8d82b75f1fa8ca870b5a5271a4c61c02bf65b044b4d742a92f7701", "ja": "お兄ちゃん、やっと来た！\n桃子、聞きたいことがあるんだけど。", "zh": "大哥哥，你终于来了！\n桃子有事想问你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0104_1002_p", "source_sha256": "515426747cfa36143f1e53410ad6371f3b96a4099e86cb6d9a314f133d910e6c", "ja": "うん、どうかしたのか？", "zh": "嗯，怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0104_1003_049mom", "source_sha256": "5cad3abe63a7a0670a50e395c09842a83262f161940417b5168bfb40b23d18bc", "ja": "事務室にあったアルバムのことなんだけど、\nあれってどういうこと？", "zh": "关于事务室的相簿，\n那是怎么回事？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0104_1004_p", "source_sha256": "2960de8d6f7fedc109ff94b96a14ed10714aa0c6bebca9c2dcd20e77d15f26fb", "ja": "アルバム？　ああ、『アイドル大運動会』のか。\nアルバムがどうかしたのか？", "zh": "相簿？喔喔，你是说『偶像大运动会』的那本吧？\n相簿怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0104_1005_049mom", "source_sha256": "13e863570f0df377469528231f725dbd8bc43d75b2bfc70057638d10d35f5111", "ja": "「どうかしたのか？」じゃないよ！　アルバム\n見たけど、桃子のリレーの写真、全然なかったよ？", "zh": "你还敢问「怎么了吗」！\n桃子看了相簿，里面完全没有桃子跑接力赛的照片！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0104_1006_049mom", "source_sha256": "f939f776dda3a02a5e52849c3ac7437a30f754a2777b2432d946fcb16db07c62", "ja": "桃子、絶対勝ちたかったから\nリレーでも一生懸命がんばったのに……！", "zh": "桃子无论如何都想赢，\n所以连接力赛都那么拚命在跑耶……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0104_1007_p", "source_sha256": "374919ba2d15cdd20033df79c85ffa09ed1c86ae70b4286148b875a174619de5", "ja": "ああ、その事か！　実は、最初に用意してた\nアルバムのページが、全然足りなくなっちゃって……。", "zh": "啊啊，原来是这样！\n其实是因为一开始准备的相簿页数完全不够……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0104_1008_p", "source_sha256": "3149c61df9449b39d05df49d0a098c166e0ecbca655e7cab700213f2f83e1b65", "ja": "リレーの写真は特によく撮れていたから\n2冊目にまとめておいたって、青羽さんが言ってたよ。", "zh": "而接力赛的照片又拍得特别好，\n所以一起整理在第二本了，青羽小姐是这么说的喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0104_1009_049mom", "source_sha256": "628354de2f17346eb0de9c70736fc218147ba8447b2950f26db0317ceb4e760d", "ja": "えっ……に、2冊目？\n他にもアルバムがあるの？", "zh": "咦……第、第二本？\n还有别本相簿吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0104_1010_p", "source_sha256": "ba694652690f5ad9ea326dc3e0f1b4a851b099dcb82e36e5e01a0f9dd43c3ee7", "ja": "うん。ここに一緒に置いておいたんだけど……\nないみたいだ。誰か見てるのかな？", "zh": "嗯，我原本一起放在这里的……\n现在似乎不在，可能有人拿去看了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0104_1011_049mom", "source_sha256": "679617b7565bdffc6be9bd39abb0d8200367a0e63884f7a0f5f68fdce99ee1a6", "ja": "ふ……ふーん。\nそうだったんだ……。", "zh": "哦……哦～\n是喔……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0104_1012_049mom", "source_sha256": "a8b01dfea6db680d951f6a13e22985bbc520f8b39612f2af6cd4a391ab28071b", "ja": "そ、そういう事なら、許してあげる。\n……桃子の写真がないのかと思って、焦っちゃった。", "zh": "这、这样的话桃子就原谅你。\n……原以为没有桃子的照片，还觉得很慌张。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0104_1013_p", "source_sha256": "72b484684727a7900052cfa29016ec0853a8d5cd5b1d7864deef2766aa07e74d", "ja": "そんな事はないよ。桃子、一生懸命頑張ったもんな。\nみんなと一緒に、たくさん写ってるよ。", "zh": "才不会呢，桃子你可是拚了命在努力嘛。\n很多照片都有拍到你和大家在一起的模样喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0104_1014_p", "source_sha256": "2cf9aceb9b52075f7bf395c330a2df3c6c1c368066b2cb65c80dbd1482709ce3", "ja": "あ、そうだ。せっかくだから、今から一緒に見ないか？\nアルバムを探すついでだ。", "zh": "啊，对了，要不要干脆趁这个机会一起看照片？\n找到相簿后顺便来看。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0104_1015_049mom", "source_sha256": "1ff707868bacc9f0fd6788eec9f9d3635e42e324b7b93a3201532aefffb80b89", "ja": "う、うん。……お兄ちゃんが見たいなら、いいよ。\n桃子、付き合ってあげる。", "zh": "好、好啊……如果大哥哥想看的话，\n桃子可以陪你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0104_1016_p", "source_sha256": "431f247c8df0690992a1db09d41b7db07f0df4171b41dc01b1e4199fab84aeee", "ja": "ありがとう。\nそれじゃ、まずは……事務室からかな。", "zh": "谢谢你。\n那首先……就从事务室找起吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0104_1017_049mom", "source_sha256": "aed91dc922127813b5ac0db08a870cbec7254a65bf5b504f233b3af87b1a81d5", "ja": "うん、そうだね。\n消えたアルバムの行方を探すよ、お兄ちゃん！", "zh": "嗯，也对，\n那就出发去找消失的相簿啰，大哥哥！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0104_1018_049mom", "source_sha256": "e893f691b17d5ad8aa1ff8959d95d819fc2e9880bb82cd4ce3daf684a4d70c88", "ja": "桃子はアイドルでだって、絶対1位になるんだから。\nこれは、貴重な記録なんだからね♪", "zh": "毕竟桃子绝对会成为第一名的偶像，\n所以这可是珍贵的纪录呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
